<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="UIT_Logo_2025 (image)">
  <data key="d0">UIT_Logo_2025 (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This logo represents the University of Information Technology, Ho Chi Minh City, emphasizing innovation and progress through its dynamic design. It appears as part of a student handbook for advanced studies, highlighting the institution's focus on technology and education in the year 2025.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-defe6e1b06b81fd70af78dc9b1e37091</data>
