</node>
<node id="UIT Campus Architectural Rendering (image)">
  <data key="d0">UIT Campus Architectural Rendering (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This architectural rendering depicts the modern, sustainable design of the Information Technology University campus, highlighting green spaces and central plazas. It visually supports the academic guidebook's content by showcasing the learning environment for graduate students enrolled in the 2025 intake.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09c44b80ba5a63bbf48be44d2a8b0472</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
