</node>
<node id="Page 1 of Table of Contents (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page 1 of Table of Contents (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number '1' marks the introductory section of the graduate student handbook, establishing navigational structure for administrative and academic guidelines. It signals the start of the document's organized content, facilitating access to critical information for doctoral candidates in the 20/2025 cohort. This element serves as a foundational reference point within the broader academic support framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0cdf905ff54dd042e76cc278ee4a910a</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
