</node>
<node id="Graduate Academic Handbook Contents (list)">
  <data key="d0">Graduate Academic Handbook Contents (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">A structured list of sections detailing postgraduate program requirements, curriculum frameworks, and administrative procedures. Covers application criteria, training objectives, fees, graduation protocols, and academic support, serving as a navigational guide for students and staff within the university's academic framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d5242b36e0c2be4f8fe0c3d200f21d0</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
