</node>
<node id="Page 2 of Graduate Student Academic Guide (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page 2 of Graduate Student Academic Guide (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number '2' identifies the second page of the 2025 graduate student handbook, part of an internal academic document outlining procedures for postgraduate studies. It serves as a navigational reference within a structured guide detailing enrollment, research, and administrative protocols for the 2025 cohort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b542c238eadd48f3bab8ba21e750dc8e</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
<node id="Master's Training Regulations - Page 3 (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Master's Training Regulations - Page 3 (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 3 details the implementation guidelines, training objectives, and structural parameters for the master's program. It specifies full-time enrollment (2-year duration), research-focused goals, and compliance requirements for HVCH 2025, aligning with regulatory frameworks and supplementary resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c24272c3820aa1810a37959925614c91</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
<node id="Research Master's Program Structure (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Research Master's Program Structure (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 4 details the Research Master's Program's objectives, emphasizing advanced research skills, critical thinking, and independent scientific work. It outlines the program's focus on original research, thesis requirements, and alignment with academic and professional development goals, supporting the broader regulatory framework for postgraduate studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-85c1f9ffb94a147439e48d4e61010010</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
<node id="Training Method and Curriculum Framework Information List (list)">
  <data key="d0">Training Method and Curriculum Framework Information List (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list outlines key administrative details for the master's program: distribution of discipline-specific course frameworks and classification of training methods. It supports the curriculum structure requirements mentioned in the document's 'Cấu trúc chương trình đào tạo' section, ensuring clarity on resource access and methodological categorization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b9819efbde6f7cef0fe52c23895ed27a</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
