  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 8 is part of a master's program regulatory document, serving as a navigational element between thesis requirements (page 6) and administrative procedures (page 8). It contextualizes academic regulations, including thesis submission timelines, registration conditions, and program-specific frameworks, supporting structured knowledge retrieval about graduate program protocols.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0442138875dd231e197813c7af4502b</data>
