  <data key="d0">Page 9 - Course Registration Procedures (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 9 details graduate student course registration rules, including credit limits, prerequisites, and deadlines. It ensures academic compliance and resource allocation, aligning with broader program requirements and administrative frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-695a201d713fe3d8531774799de3df16</data>
