  <data key="d2">A navigational page number indicator (text: '10 ') within a regulatory document governing graduate studies. It serves as a structural marker linking procedural sections on thesis defense extensions, course registration, and academic compliance. Its placement highlights the document’s formal organization, ensuring alignment with administrative guidelines for research and coursework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d573f18b4ce386fd5799c7e76626c65e</data>
