<node id="Thesis Defense Conditions (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Thesis Defense Conditions (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 11 outlines four critical criteria for master's thesis defense: minimum GPA requirement (5.5/10), absence of legal/disciplinary issues, advisor approval, and committee endorsement. These conditions ensure academic integrity and readiness for graduation, serving as the final evaluation phase after course registration and thesis proposal processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8024ddf079d299e45251a1b7e8cfa883</data>
