  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">The list details requirements for extending thesis deadlines (tuition compliance, financial responsibility) and topic management protocols (department head oversight, rector approval for changes). It ensures administrative accountability and procedural adherence in master's programs, linking to graduation criteria and academic governance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7824d3a987040769b122a0916d3236e2</data>
