  <data key="d2">Page 11 serves as a procedural link between course retake protocols (page 10) and graduation requirements (page 12). It references key academic governance elements including thesis proposal timelines, defense eligibility criteria, and graduation documentation standards. The page's numerical designation ('12 ') likely indicates a section reference within a structured regulatory framework governing master's degree completion.</data>
