  <data key="d0">Thesis Defense and Graduation Prerequisites (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">A list of two critical requirements for thesis defense and graduation: program completion per regulations and English language proficiency. These conditions function as prerequisites within the academic framework, ensuring candidates meet institutional standards before advancing to final degree evaluation. They connect to broader graduation criteria, emphasizing compliance with procedural and competency-based thresholds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe78d6b7dbe1e518ca2f94bb77ad0c73</data>
