  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list outlines mandatory documents for thesis defense and graduation: certified undergraduate degree copy, foreign language compliance proof, and full academic transcript. These requirements ensure academic eligibility and procedural compliance within the master's program framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8a0c36130f5a3a675ae6f78ed1b7063</data>
