  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list specifies mandatory documents for master's thesis submission and graduation, including scientific resumes, defense dossiers, and library confirmation. It aligns with institutional graduation criteria and ensures compliance with academic regulations, supporting the formalization of degree issuance and record-keeping processes.</data>
