  <data key="d2">Page 13 contains the page number '14' and serves as a navigational element between sections on graduation requirements (page 12) and temporary leave policies (page 14). It maintains document pagination but lacks direct content. The page is part of a structured regulatory document governing master's degree programs, connecting academic eligibility, evaluation metrics, and training flexibility.</data>
