  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 16 details regulations for extending study periods, requiring trainees to complete official coursework within 2 years. It outlines eligibility criteria, institutional approval processes, and ties to broader academic policies on transfers and disciplinary compliance. (98 words)</data>
