  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list specifies three conditions affecting academic progression: completion of one master's year, active disciplinary status, and unresolved financial obligations. It aligns with institutional policies on academic standing and disciplinary actions, serving as a compliance checklist for student administrative processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b38bbf7ad7bd73df8e194ef0fe47ddf6</data>
