  <data key="d2">Page 16 serves as a navigational reference within academic regulations, bridging sections on program transfers (Page 15) and disciplinary actions (Page 17). Though containing minimal text ('17 '), it contextualizes institutional policies governing student academic status, transfers, and misconduct, supporting structured retrieval of regulatory content.</data>
