  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">The list outlines four requirements for students to qualify for an academic study period extension: timely tuition payment, no severe disciplinary actions, submitting an application, and paying the extension fee. These conditions ensure compliance with institutional regulations and financial obligations, supporting the broader academic governance framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5137c606cba571c6c01a85f65563a320</data>
