  <data key="d2">Page number '17' marks the transition to disciplinary regulations (11.2.3) detailing expulsion grounds for academic misconduct. It connects to prior sections on academic reactivation and transfers, maintaining structural coherence in institutional policies. The entity serves as a reference point for retrieving rules on severe violations like fraud, plagiarism, and proxy exams, which trigger formal disciplinary actions.</data>
