</node>
<node id="Quyền Hạn Cố Vấn Học Tập (CVHT) (list)">
  <data key="d0">Quyền Hạn Cố Vấn Học Tập (CVHT) (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list outlines the rights of academic advisors (CVHT) in a master's program, including requesting class reports, accessing information, attending meetings, and organizing class meetings. These rights enable effective student support and coordination with university departments, aligning with the broader regulatory framework for academic management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09168b7b218b37c8ebc227a5debc22d0</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
<node id="CVHT Rights and Benefits (list)">
  <data key="d0">CVHT Rights and Benefits (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list details financial incentives for academic advisors (CVHT), including subsidies, reduced teaching hours, and additional departmental benefits. It ensures institutional support for CVHT roles, aligning with broader policies on academic management and resource allocation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ebd0d017cee57fe17d8d2f53e968e2a</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
<node id="CVHT Evaluation and Discipline Guidelines (list)">
  <data key="d0">CVHT Evaluation and Discipline Guidelines (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list defines performance evaluation criteria for CVHTs, linking outcomes to rewards, penalties, and institutional accountability. It ensures alignment with academic management standards by establishing measurable performance expectations and consequences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f95af3eea81d38aa7436f5ad1452c11c</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
