  <data key="d0">Bảng Tổng hợp CVHT của các khoa (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table evaluates Academic Advisors' performance across task execution, class meeting compliance, and final classifications. It ensures accountability for CVHTs, aligning with institutional policies on rights, rewards, and discipline. The structured format supports administrative oversight and quality control in academic advising.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4efb7aa590362ee929699dc122240f7</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779116212</data>
</node>
