  <data key="d0">Danh sách Thông tin Cá nhân Học viên cho Cố vấn học tập (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list details personal and academic data points required for academic advising, supporting institutional reporting and student monitoring. It includes identifiers, contact info, academic records, and administrative details, ensuring standardized information flow for effective counseling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3f388e1bd5cc5e2666e8f641ac6047c4</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
