  <data key="d0">Phụ lục 2. Thông tin cá nhân học viên được cung cấp cho CVHT (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header introduces Appendix 2, which outlines the personal information of students provided to academic advisors. It is part of a structured academic counseling reporting framework, ensuring advisors have necessary student data for guidance. The section connects to broader institutional processes of academic oversight and administrative documentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17e4adf609114cf618a534f00a964fe6</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
