  <data key="d0">Class Meeting Documentation Checklist (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">A structured list outlining critical details (time, location, participants) for recording class meetings, supporting administrative compliance and CVHT responsibilities within academic governance frameworks. Part of formal meeting documentation procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a103f8a70f80ca7a5fea566562d2d00a</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
