<node id="Appendix 3: Class Meeting Minutes Template (header)">
  <data key="d0">Appendix 3: Class Meeting Minutes Template (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">A standardized template for documenting class meetings, ensuring structured recording of dates, participants, and discussions. It supports academic advising reporting requirements and maintains administrative transparency in student affairs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-538a5d82183c6f1d7ae655aaa7f4228e</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
