  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header introduces an appendix detailing academic advising activities, structured to document tasks, class management, and meetings. It serves as a formal record for verifying advisor responsibilities within institutional administrative frameworks, linking to broader governance processes through standardized reporting and verification mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-43d58cecd09de76433bb8b5299358c93</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
