</node>
<node id="Performance Evaluation Criteria for Academic Advisors (list)">
  <data key="d0">Performance Evaluation Criteria for Academic Advisors (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">A four-tiered evaluation list for academic advisors to self-assess task completion. It defines performance levels from 'excellent' to 'not completed,' aligning with institutional standards for class management, counseling, and reporting. This supports accountability in academic administration and policy implementation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4df7c79b3afe9c264538109c1fb91697</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
