  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header identifies the institutional authority (University of National University in Ho Chi Minh City) overseeing the master's training regulations. It contextualizes the document's governance structure, linking it to the broader academic framework and legal policies outlined in the surrounding content, such as scholarship applications and program-specific requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d463511f2dfe174a5cf0f00261c2cf6</data>
