  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">Official document identifier for the regulation on scientific publication support at ĐHCNTT, replacing prior policy (561/QĐ-ĐHCNTT). It establishes institutional compliance mechanisms under higher-level administrative frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96e1cf70c4d4352d9f300b6fe352e333</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
