  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header identifies the document as an official Vietnamese administrative text, establishing its legitimacy under the Socialist Republic of Vietnam. It contextualizes the regulatory content on academic publication support within national legal frameworks, linking university policies to state-level governance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84006b23d400e8958e9a1bda50957593</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
