  <data key="d0">Document Issuance Location and Date (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header specifies the geographic and temporal context of the official decision, establishing its jurisdiction and validity. It anchors the policy document to Ho Chi Minh City and June 1, 2023, supporting administrative traceability and legal compliance within the university's governance framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7eaadd59fb259701aea9cee7955d622d</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
