  <data key="d0">Danh sách các nguồn tài chính hỗ trợ công bố khoa học (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list identifies four financial sources for supporting scientific publications at the University of Information Technology, including state budget, domestic/international funding, the university's research fund, and other legal sources. It provides the financial framework to implement the regulation's objectives of encouraging research among students and researchers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-121e90697f677a4e765a65297c3cdc1c</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
