  <data key="d0">Quy trình Tuyên dương và Hỗ trợ Công bố Khoa học (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">The table details the implementation process for commendations and publication support for students and researchers, aligning with Article 5 and 6 regulations. It specifies responsibilities for departments like ĐTSĐH&amp;KHCN, Khoa, CTSV, and KHTC, using forms such as Phụ lục 1-9 to ensure compliance and transparency in annual support periods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ed76bf975919610fe93220cc4d4eacfb</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779107566</data>
</node>
