  <data key="d0">Regulatory Guidelines for Academic Commendations and Scientific Publication Support (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">Regulatory guidelines for academic commendations and scientific publication support for students, postgraduates, and doctoral candidates. Outlines responsibilities, applicability from May 2023, and procedures for addressing implementation issues. Aligns with institutional policies on research and student development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5ed707e439fa6849dd0d703a8f05677</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
