  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table documents student research publication funding requests at Trường Đại học Công nghệ Thông tin. It tracks author details, paper metadata, and ranking-based support allocations, aligning with institutional financial regulations and interdepartmental approval processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d5e732e82984de8a1ef8a27e82083e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea08f25fe53639be3a32f9d3143ee3c</data>
