  <data key="d0">Bảng Đề Xuất Mức Hỗ Trợ Công Bố Khoa Học (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table is a funding proposal template for scientific publication support, tracking student details, support levels, and banking information. It serves as a draft form for departments to submit requests, aligning with the university's research administrative processes. Contains two incomplete entries for students Ng Văn A and Ng Văn B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7f22f5adae1c01a623d4522e17af902</data>
