  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table outlines financial support proposals for scientific publications by students and researchers. It includes placeholders for student details, support amounts, and bank information, serving as a template for formalizing funding requests. The structure aligns with the university's regulatory compliance requirements, emphasizing transparency in financial approvals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59b7b3493e766f5232a83ea6ddd27cb</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
