  <data key="d0">Departments Involved in Financial Support for Research Publications (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list identifies key administrative departments (ĐTSĐH&amp;KHCN, KHTC) responsible for managing financial support processes for scientific publications. It reflects institutional workflows for research funding approvals and payments, directly connecting to formal documentation templates for academic financial compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7785f0bf7d474d9873431a24aaedb791</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
