  <data key="d0">DANH SÁCH TUYÊN DƯƠNG NGHIÊN CỨU KHOA HỌC (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table is a template for documenting scientific research awards at the University of Information Technology. It tracks awardees' details, including departments and publication metrics, and is part of Appendix 8 managed by the Office for Postgraduate Studies and Scientific Research. The empty structure suggests it is intended for future data entry to support administrative reporting on student and postgraduate research contributions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f65de337874afaca896e8e869fb83a85</data>
