  <data key="d0">BẢNG THỐNG KÊ SỐ BÀI BÁO KHOA HỌC ĐỀ XUẤT NHẬN HỐ TRỢ NGHIÊN CỨU KHOA HỌC SINH VIÊN, HỌC VIÊN SAU ĐẠI HỌC (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table is designed to track scientific papers submitted by students and postgraduates for research funding. It includes columns for paper titles, conference/journal details, rankings, departments, and notes. Despite its structured format, it contains no data, suggesting it is a placeholder for institutional reporting on academic research activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b1cad9d789777a6847e8895c705c22b</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
