  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number marker for Appendix 7 in an administrative document series, part of a standardized format for academic institutional reporting. Links to research funding statistics and departmental approvals within the Information Technology University's governance framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d9ef0a9a165a6625e92e5e2b00991d5</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
