  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table is a template for tracking student and postgraduate research proposals at the University of Information Technology. It structures data by paper title, conference/journal, ranking, and department, but lacks populated entries. It supports administrative oversight of research funding and aligns with appendices for formal documentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c065f506220069885e5102bf3efaedaa</data>
