<node id="University of Information Technology Header (header)">
  <data key="d0">University of Information Technology Header (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">Identifies the University of Information Technology in a document header, contextualized within academic administrative forms. Serves as a structural element linking appendices, departmental data, and institutional oversight. Critical for document categorization and administrative traceability in Vietnamese higher education contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aba701315f53ce2ff45d4e1e3a88922d</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
