  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 40 details credit transfer rules, elective course options (e.g., CE2200/CE2201), and thesis requirements for master's programs. It specifies 12-credit maximum transfers from other departments, mandates research publications for thesis eligibility, and outlines procedures for course equivalency approvals. These policies support academic flexibility while maintaining research rigor.</data>
