  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table lists approved course equivalencies and credit substitution rules for master's programs in Computer Engineering at ĐH CNTT, enabling students to transfer credits from other programs and select specialized courses. It supports academic flexibility while adhering to program requirements, such as the 12-credit maximum for substitutions and thesis eligibility criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-215fdeb8da96bc26ab155b5174a12c23</data>
