  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list specifies academic output requirements for two graduation thesis pathways: research (Method 2) and application-oriented. It mandates primary authorship of international publications or application solutions, referencing syllabi for details. These criteria align with credit transfer policies and academic standards outlined in the surrounding context, emphasizing scholarly rigor and practical relevance in master's programs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0142f28219fec713136b3e7c2681d2eb</data>
