  <data key="d2">This list defines evaluation outcomes for academic advisors (CVHT), linking performance to rewards or disciplinary actions. It establishes accountability mechanisms, aligns with institutional management frameworks, and supports the broader discussion on CVHT responsibilities and quality assurance in postgraduate programs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-412d7ac757951df584de37382aac8e38</data>
