  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list defines the implementation timeline and amendment procedures for the academic advisor regulation. It establishes the effective date upon signing and outlines reporting channels for issues during execution, with final decision-making authority resting with the Rector. The content ensures regulatory adaptability while maintaining institutional oversight, directly supporting the governance framework for CVHT roles within the university context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2e0f07756288a40a3345919cc6c4834</data>
