  <data key="d2">This header establishes a formal section for academic advising documentation within institutional records. It frames procedural elements like student data management, advising evaluations, and class meeting records. The entity connects to appendices, reporting requirements, and administrative authentication processes, supporting structured knowledge retrieval for academic governance and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f1b007aa690f603fe95f27d0116068b7</data>
