  <data key="d2">This header introduces a formal report detailing academic advising activities, class management, and institutional compliance. It serves as a structured documentation component for faculty accountability, linking to surrounding administrative processes and evaluations. The report includes task listings, self-assessment, and leadership reviews, critical for academic governance and student support systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99f68d8ba2df05a06d26ee92404dd667</data>
