  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header serves as the official document number for a regulatory decree issued by the University of Information Technology (ĐHCNTT). It identifies the specific policy framework for scientific publication support, replacing prior regulations (e.g., 561/QĐ-ĐHCNTT) and establishing administrative authority within the university's governance structure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6521c49cdb3b862e8b809339832b1413</data>
