  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">The header specifies the document's issuance location (Ho Chi Minh City) and date (June 1, 2023), establishing its administrative jurisdiction and temporal validity. This metadata directly supports the regulatory content of the decision, ensuring traceability within the university's policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39de2b0d0dc950a9e9bcd651b434da9b</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
