<node id="Financial Support Sources for Scientific Publications (list)">
  <data key="d0">Financial Support Sources for Scientific Publications (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list outlines four financial sources for the university's scientific publication support policy: state budget, domestic/international funding, institutional research funds, and legal alternative sources. It provides the financial framework necessary for implementing the regulation's support mechanisms for students and researchers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b658f615b9f388dc9a33bbe5c3d0abc</data>
