  <data key="d0">Support Allocation for Scientific Publications (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">The table defines support percentages for scientific publications based on author roles, aligning with policies for commendations and funding. It specifies 100% support for main authors (HVCH/NCS) and 50% for student co-authors, ensuring equitable distribution. This structure supports the context's guidelines for academic recognition and resource allocation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1cfa3b7d14d2d6195e537a8537781e2</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
