  <data key="d0">Điều 7. Tổ chức thực hiện (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">The table specifies roles for scientific publication support under Điều 7, detailing tasks for ĐTSĐH&amp;KHCN, Khoa, CTSV, and KHTC. It aligns with Điều 5 (commendations for publications) and Điều 6 (biannual application periods) by outlining workflows, forms (e.g., Phụ lục 3, 4, 7, 8), and responsibilities to ensure compliance and transparency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-53153173ad3af4ad0fa08fab84589f1c</data>
