  <data key="d0">Regulation on Scientific Publication Support for Students and Researchers (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list defines responsibilities for implementing scientific publication support and commendation procedures for students, postgraduates, and PhD candidates. It establishes applicability from May 2023, mandates reporting of implementation issues to ĐTSĐH&amp;KHCN, and aligns with institutional frameworks outlined in adjacent pages, ensuring compliance and procedural clarity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4058c290ae393d15ba5434b9b5b590b</data>
