  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table records financial support details for students, faculty, and doctoral candidates in scientific publications. It includes student identifiers, support levels, and banking information, serving as a template for formal funding proposals. It aligns with administrative processes outlined in appendices, ensuring structured documentation for research funding approvals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d2bfe8af9580dda95638207748a0b0f</data>
