  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table tracks financial support proposals and payments for scientific publications by students and researchers. It includes two entries (Ng Văn A and Ng Văn B) with empty support details, serving as a template for future allocations. The context highlights its role in administrative processes for the University of Information Technology, with emphasis on bank-specific payment procedures (Vietcombank, Bidv).</data>
