  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list identifies administrative departments (Postgraduate &amp; Scientific Research Department, Science &amp; Technology Funding Department) responsible for proposing and managing financial support for academic publications. It reflects institutional workflows for research funding approvals, aligning with appendices detailing financial disbursement protocols and stakeholder roles in university governance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c40a876e78c6bba623f6b0856aec0a3</data>
