  <data key="d2">Page 70 contains 'Phụ lục 7,' a standardized administrative form for compiling statistics on scientific research proposals. It aligns with adjacent appendices (5, 6, 8) and supports institutional data reporting workflows. The page features structural elements like institutional headers, date fields, and signature lines, reflecting its role in formal academic documentation and compliance.</data>
