  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table tracks scientific papers submitted for research grants by students and postgraduates, structured with serial numbers, paper titles, conference/journal details, rankings, departments, and notes. It serves as a template for administrative reporting, aligning with the university's requirement to document research activities for funding compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ae14722263e9b0509ad70fd8d35e1f6</data>
