  <data key="d2">The header identifies the 'Postgraduate and Technology Science Department' (PHÒNG ĐTSĐH&amp;KHCN), a university administrative unit responsible for overseeing postgraduate education and technology-related research. It is part of a formal checklist for research proposal submissions, linking to institutional governance structures through its association with required administrative details like totals, dates, and departmental signatories.</data>
