  <data key="d2">Page 71 is a sequential identifier in an academic document containing appendices for research grant applications. It links to checklist requirements and administrative forms, supporting institutional compliance with documentation standards. The page number facilitates navigation within a structured framework of academic record-keeping.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-25936f4008cba8da3f1ba4725687454d</data>
