  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 73 is a structural placeholder in the 'Quy định về việc cấp học bổng' document, marking a section continuation (e.g., 'Điều 3') within the regulatory framework for postgraduate scholarships at ĐHCNTT. It supports administrative compliance with higher-level decrees and ensures organized implementation of financial aid policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e6f07a730bf278242bc6b1200ae5c78b</data>
