  <data key="d0">Scholarship Regulations for Postgraduate Students at ĐH CNTT (list)</data>
  <data key="d1">list</data>
  <data key="d2">This list defines the scope and purpose of a regulatory document governing scholarship provisions for master's and doctoral students at ĐH CNTT, ĐHQG-HCM. It outlines the allocation of academic encouragement scholarships and sponsored scholarships to motivate postgraduate research and study, aligning with institutional and national higher education policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb870824899d2075764cc72aca258e23</data>
