  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 74 contains the page_number '4' marking the start of Article 4 in the scholarship regulations for postgraduate students. This article defines the Study Encouragement Scholarship for master's candidates based on entrance performance, aligning with institutional policies and legal frameworks to promote academic excellence and financial support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-099582f46fb80bc3316bf8a432db07e2</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
