  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">This page details criteria for postgraduate encouragement scholarships at UIT, including Type 1 (entrance-based) and Type 2 (academic performance-based) scholarships. It outlines eligibility timelines, evaluation metrics, and allocation priorities, ensuring transparency in financial aid distribution for master's programs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50770f1ae55c6b8bc2390d1763d21b95</data>
  <data key="d4">cam_nang_sau_dai_hoc_2025_0.pdf</data>
