  <data key="d0">Page 76 - Scholarship Regulations Framework (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 76 is part of a regulatory document detailing scholarship categories, evaluation principles, and eligibility criteria for postgraduate students. It connects to surrounding content by reinforcing structured scholarship administration, prioritization frameworks, and institutional policies governing merit-based and sponsored awards.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6568996119e3a2dbaeb1fb00d0b6209c</data>
